{"claim_id": "c1", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-011", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "根据规则，一个人同一时刻只能在一个架次上。"}
{"claim_id": "c2", "human": "PARTIAL", "item_id": "JCAL-011", "judge": "PARTIAL", "kind": "claim", "text": "这是为了确保执行人能够专注于当前的课目并满足资质匹配与岗位互斥的要求。"}
{"claim_id": "c4", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-011", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "- 约束4·资质匹配与岗位互斥（R0，预筛 + NoOverlap）明确规定：执行人须持该课目所属类别资质；"}
{"claim_id": "c5", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-011", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "同一人同一时刻只能在一个架次上。"}
{"claim_id": "c6", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-011", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "因此，一个人在同一时间只能参与一个架次的飞行任务。"}
{"claim_id": "c2", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-012", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "1. **约束1·时间一致性**（R0，结构性）：着陆时刻 = 起飞时刻 + 课目时长；"}
{"claim_id": "c3", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-012", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "架次必须落在训练窗内且不跨日。"}
