{"claim_id": "c5", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-012", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "维护时段内不得排班。"}
{"claim_id": "c6", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-012", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "3. **约束8·人员冲突与休息**（R0，析取 + 序）：同一人相邻架次间隔不少于 10 分钟；"}
