{"claim_id": "c2", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-045", "judge": "PARTIAL", "kind": "claim", "text": "这意味着在第 1 周时，安排是严格按照松弛档 Tier 0 进行的，没有遗留问题。"}
{"claim_id": "c3", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-045", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "关于资源有效性与容量方面，同一空域同时存在的飞机架数不可超过该空域的 同时段容量。"}
{"claim_id": "c5", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-045", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "- 空域 RT2 的同时段容量为 1 架次"}
{"claim_id": "c6", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-045", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "- 空域 SAB 的同时段容量为 2 架次"}
{"claim_id": "c7", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-045", "judge": "PARTIAL", "kind": "claim", "text": "这些信息可以作为第 2 周安排时参考的基础，确保资源的有效利用和容量的合规性。"}
{"claim_id": "c2", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-046", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "单人单日的架次数和单机单日的架次数不得超过设定的上限。"}
{"claim_id": "c3", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-046", "judge": "PARTIAL", "kind": "claim", "text": "具体数值需要参照具体的规章制度来确定。"}
{"claim_id": "c5", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-046", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "- 每日飞行时长也有一个上限。"}
{"claim_id": "c6", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-046", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "- 单人单周内的总架次数也有限制。"}
{"claim_id": "c7", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-046", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "- 同一跑道在任意 20 分钟滑动窗口内起飞次数不得超过 2 次，并且任意两架次起飞时刻间隔不少于 7 分钟。"}
{"claim_id": "c1", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-047", "judge": "NOT_SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "根据检索到的相关内容，没有直接提到目标函数三项权重的具体数值。"}
{"claim_id": "c2", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-047", "judge": "NOT_SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "因此无法从这些信息中得出您偏好的目标函数三项权重是多少。"}
{"claim_id": "c4", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-047", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "- 第 3 周选用 Tier 0 松弛，欠账为零。"}
{"claim_id": "c5", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-047", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "- 用户在第 18 周和第 2 周分别提出了类似的修订意见：何超少排一次、间隔拉开一点、IFR 那门课先停。"}
{"claim_id": "c6", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-047", "judge": "NOT_SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "这些信息并未涉及目标函数权重的具体数值。"}
{"claim_id": "c2", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-048", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "- 空域 IFR、RNG、RT1 和 RT2 的同时段容量均为 1 架次。"}
{"claim_id": "c3", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-048", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "- 空域 SAA 和 SAB 的同时段容量为 2 架次。"}
{"claim_id": "c4", "human": "PARTIAL", "item_id": "JCAL-048", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "因此，如果您希望选择一个能够容纳更多架次的空域，则偏好空域 SAA 或 SAB 更合适。"}
{"claim_id": "c1", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-049", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "根据之前的记录，您在第19周、第11周和第3周都提出了将跑道换成RWY-1的要求。"}
{"claim_id": "c2", "human": "PARTIAL", "item_id": "JCAL-049", "judge": "PARTIAL", "kind": "claim", "text": "这表明您对跑道有偏好，倾向于使用RWY-1。"}
{"claim_id": "c3", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-049", "judge": "PARTIAL", "kind": "claim", "text": "其他几周没有提到关于跑道的具体要求。"}
{"claim_id": "c1", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-050", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "根据之前的记录，第5周和第13周你都提出了希望“早一点起飞”的要求。"}
{"claim_id": "c2", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-050", "judge": "PARTIAL", "kind": "claim", "text": "因此，你可以考虑提前开始飞行时间以满足你的习惯。"}
{"claim_id": "c3", "human": "SUPPORTED", "item_id": "JCAL-050", "judge": "SUPPORTED", "kind": "claim", "text": "不过具体的时间安排还需要符合训练窗的规定以及确保课目时长的完整性。"}
